{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"算畴左 Kan 扩张"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"oLKE"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>类似于左 "},{"Local":{"url":"Kan扩张","text":"Kan 扩张"}},{"Plain":" 是函子范畴之间拉回的左伴随, 对于余完备"},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半范畴","text":"对称幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ 以及"},{"Local":{"url":"算畴","text":"算畴"}},{"Plain":"的态射 $f\\colon \\mathcal O\\to\\mathcal P$, 在代数范畴之间也有拉回 $f^*\\colon \\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathcal O}(\\mathcal C)$ 的左伴随\n$$\r\n    f_! \\colon \\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathcal O}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal C),\r\n$$\n称为"},{"Local":{"url":"oLKE","text":"算畴左 Kan 扩张"}},{"Plain":" (operadic left Kan extension). 代数范畴之间的拉回可视为遗忘函子, 而算畴左 Kan 扩张给出<strong>自由代数</strong>.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>具体计算式</h3>\n<p>对于 $A\\in\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathcal O}(\\mathcal C)$, $P\\in\\mathcal P$,\n$$\r\n    (f_!A)(P) = \\operatorname{colim}_{\\alpha\\colon f(O)\\to P\\text{活性}} \\pi(\\alpha)_! A(O),\r\n$$\n其中 $O\\in\\mathcal O^\\otimes$, $\\pi\\colon \\mathcal P^\\otimes\\to\\mathsf{Fin}_*$.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>分解同调</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"分解同调","text":"分解同调"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}